 Flow  Looks  Fonts  Settings  Help       View file  Save  Install  Revert  New
 draft mine  ›  new path   1 keyboard, 1 pointer and 1 display in no path yet …

 THE NEW PATH'S TERMINAL · every VT

   Name                            desk   Enter types a new name
   Font set                       proof
   Size                           automatic
   VTs                            every VT
   Consoles                       1
   Login                          Default: /bin/login -p
   When its screen is unplugged   keep the sessions running
   Switch on Enter                off
   Display All displays           connected

   Space on a part in PARTS connects it to this path. Enter on a part here
   disconnects it.

 WHAT THIS TERMINAL DRAWS
   Font set proof  →  look proof  →  All displays
   Filters and requirements: vtium-config does not read a look's vtlook file
   yet, so this card names the look and shows no filters.


